  "stageMapBackground": "Stage map background (themes/atlas/giga-wing-fire-sky/stage<N>_bg.png), exception granted for the maps only: FBNeo captures of gigawing with sprites and bullets not drawn (median of the captures along the scroll), joined along the scroll, reduced to half pixel, pixelated and mapped to 5 tones of this theme's tile palette. No sprite, logo or font taken from the game. Stage 6 has no background (the scenery hardly scrolls)."
